jobs.description:
For a leading international company in the logistics sector, we are looking for an SAP Solution Architect. The organization is undergoing a major digital transformation, with a strong focus on digitalization, cloud technologies, and innovation.

As an SAP Solution Architect, you will be responsible for designing, governing, and further developing the organization's SAP architecture, with a primary focus on SAP EWM and SAP S/4HANA.

You will play a key role in the ongoing digitalization of the supply chain and contribute to the integration of SAP with warehouse automation and emerging digital technologies. This position combines strategic architectural thinking with hands-on involvement in projects.

In addition, you will support the IT roadmap, help shape architectural decisions, and work closely with business stakeholders, SAP teams, and technical experts to deliver scalable and future-proof solutions.

Profile

• You have 7+ years of experience working within SAP environments;
• Experience as a Solution Architect is a strong asset. Candidates with several years of experience as a Functional Analyst SAP EWM are also encouraged to apply;
• Hands-on experience with SAP EWM is essential;
• You possess strong analytical and architectural skills;
• You are fluent in English, both written and spoken.
